{
  "book": "jacob",
  "bookName": "Jacob",
  "chapter": 1,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 278.49,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 6.502,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For behold, it came to pass that fifty and five years had passed away from the time that Lehi left Jerusalem;",
      "verse": "1:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 6.682,
      "end": 9.933,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, Nephi gave me, Jacob, a commandment",
      "verse": "1:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 10.113,
      "end": 12.017,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "concerning the small plates,",
      "verse": "1:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 12.197,
      "end": 14.658,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "upon which these things are engraven.",
      "verse": "1:1",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 15.338,
      "end": 20.864,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he gave me, Jacob, a commandment that I should write upon these plates",
      "verse": "1:2",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 21.044,
      "end": 24.62,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "a few of the things which I considered to be most precious;",
      "verse": "1:2",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 24.8,
      "end": 27.819,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I should not touch, save it were lightly,",
      "verse": "1:2",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 27.999,
      "end": 32.643,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "concerning the history of this people which are called the people of Nephi.",
      "verse": "1:2",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 33.323,
      "end": 38.339,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For he said that the history of his people should be engraven upon his other plates,",
      "verse": "1:3",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 38.519,
      "end": 45.578,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that I should preserve these plates and hand them down unto my seed, from generation to generation.",
      "verse": "1:3",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 46.258,
      "end": 48.998,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And if there were preaching which was sacred,",
      "verse": "1:4",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 49.178,
      "end": 52.197,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or revelation which was great, or prophesying,",
      "verse": "1:4",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 52.377,
      "end": 55.953,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I should engraven the heads of them upon these plates,",
      "verse": "1:4",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 56.133,
      "end": 61.799,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and touch upon them as much as it were possible, for Christ's sake, and for the sake of our people.",
      "verse": "1:4",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 62.479,
      "end": 65.451,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For because of faith and great anxiety,",
      "verse": "1:5",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 65.631,
      "end": 69.625,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "it truly had been made manifest unto us concerning our people,",
      "verse": "1:5",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 69.805,
      "end": 72.359,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "what things should happen unto them.",
      "verse": "1:5",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 73.039,
      "end": 75.454,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And we also had many revelations,",
      "verse": "1:6",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 75.634,
      "end": 78.467,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the spirit of much prophecy;",
      "verse": "1:6",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 78.647,
      "end": 81.805,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, we knew of Christ and his kingdom,",
      "verse": "1:6",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 81.985,
      "end": 83.239,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which should come.",
      "verse": "1:6",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 83.919,
      "end": 87.634,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore we labored diligently among our people,",
      "verse": "1:7",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 87.814,
      "end": 90.647,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that we might persuade them to come unto Christ,",
      "verse": "1:7",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 90.827,
      "end": 93.381,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and partake of the goodness of God,",
      "verse": "1:7",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 93.561,
      "end": 96.069,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they might enter into his rest,",
      "verse": "1:7",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 96.249,
      "end": 99.407,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "lest by any means he should swear in his wrath",
      "verse": "1:7",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 99.587,
      "end": 101.212,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they should not enter in,",
      "verse": "1:7",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 101.392,
      "end": 104.364,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "as in the provocation in the days of temptation",
      "verse": "1:7",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 104.544,
      "end": 107.655,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "while the children of Israel were in the wilderness.",
      "verse": "1:7",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 108.335,
      "end": 111.679,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, we would to God that we could persuade all men",
      "verse": "1:8",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 111.859,
      "end": 115.11,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "not to rebel against God, to provoke him to anger,",
      "verse": "1:8",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 115.29,
      "end": 117.751,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but that all men would believe in Christ,",
      "verse": "1:8",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 117.931,
      "end": 119.556,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and view his death,",
      "verse": "1:8",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 119.736,
      "end": 121.454,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and suffer his cross",
      "verse": "1:8",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 121.634,
      "end": 123.77,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and bear the shame of the world;",
      "verse": "1:8",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 123.95,
      "end": 126.504,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, I, Jacob, take it upon me",
      "verse": "1:8",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 126.684,
      "end": 129.981,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to fulfil the commandment of my brother Nephi.",
      "verse": "1:8",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 130.661,
      "end": 132.565,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now Nephi began to be old,",
      "verse": "1:9",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 132.745,
      "end": 134.928,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he saw that he must soon die;",
      "verse": "1:9",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 135.108,
      "end": 139.938,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, he anointed a man to be a king and a ruler over his people",
      "verse": "1:9",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 140.118,
      "end": 142.533,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "now, according to the reigns of the kings.",
      "verse": "1:9",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 143.213,
      "end": 145.86,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "The people having loved Nephi exceedingly,",
      "verse": "1:10",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 146.04,
      "end": 148.501,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he having been a great protector for them,",
      "verse": "1:10",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 148.681,
      "end": 151.653,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "having wielded the sword of Laban in their defence,",
      "verse": "1:10",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 151.833,
      "end": 154.898,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and having labored in all his days for their welfare\u2014",
      "verse": "1:10",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 155.578,
      "end": 160.733,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, the people were desirous to retain in remembrance his name.",
      "verse": "1:11",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 160.913,
      "end": 164.303,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And whoso should reign in his stead were called by the people,",
      "verse": "1:11",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 164.483,
      "end": 169.266,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "second Nephi, third Nephi, and so forth, according to the reigns of the kings;",
      "verse": "1:11",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 169.446,
      "end": 171.722,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and thus they were called by the people,",
      "verse": "1:11",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 171.902,
      "end": 174.224,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "let them be of whatever name they would.",
      "verse": "1:11",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 174.904,
      "end": 177.365,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that Nephi died.",
      "verse": "1:12",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 178.045,
      "end": 181.574,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now the people which were not Lamanites were Nephites;",
      "verse": "1:13",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 181.754,
      "end": 186.63,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "nevertheless, they were called Nephites, Jacobites, Josephites, Zoramites,",
      "verse": "1:13",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 186.81,
      "end": 189.411,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Lamanites, Lemuelites, and Ishmaelites.",
      "verse": "1:13",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 190.091,
      "end": 194.503,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But I, Jacob, shall not hereafter distinguish them by these names,",
      "verse": "1:14",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 194.683,
      "end": 200.163,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but I shall call them Lamanites that seek to destroy the people of Nephi,",
      "verse": "1:14",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 200.343,
      "end": 207.588,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and those who are friendly to Nephi I shall call Nephites, or the people of Nephi, according to the reigns of the kings.",
      "verse": "1:14",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 208.268,
      "end": 213.469,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now it came to pass that the people of Nephi, under the reign of the second king,",
      "verse": "1:15",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 213.649,
      "end": 216.017,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "began to grow hard in their hearts,",
      "verse": "1:15",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 216.197,
      "end": 219.494,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and indulge themselves somewhat in wicked practices,",
      "verse": "1:15",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 219.674,
      "end": 221.95,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "such as like unto David of old",
      "verse": "1:15",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 222.13,
      "end": 224.684,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "desiring many wives and concubines,",
      "verse": "1:15",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 224.864,
      "end": 226.675,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also Solomon, his son.",
      "verse": "1:15",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 227.355,
      "end": 231.117,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, and they also began to search much gold and silver,",
      "verse": "1:16",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 231.297,
      "end": 234.13,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and began to be lifted up somewhat in pride.",
      "verse": "1:16",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 234.81,
      "end": 238.525,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore I, Jacob, gave unto them these words",
      "verse": "1:17",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 238.705,
      "end": 240.934,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "as I taught them in the temple,",
      "verse": "1:17",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 241.114,
      "end": 244.179,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "having first obtained mine errand from the Lord.",
      "verse": "1:17",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 244.859,
      "end": 252.057,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For I, Jacob, and my brother Joseph had been consecrated priests and teachers of this people, by the hand of Nephi.",
      "verse": "1:18",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 252.737,
      "end": 255.663,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And we did magnify our office unto the Lord,",
      "verse": "1:19",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 255.843,
      "end": 258.397,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "taking upon us the responsibility,",
      "verse": "1:19",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 258.577,
      "end": 261.642,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "answering the sins of the people upon our own heads",
      "verse": "1:19",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 261.822,
      "end": 265.677,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "if we did not teach them the word of God with all diligence;",
      "verse": "1:19",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 265.857,
      "end": 268.411,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, by laboring with our might",
      "verse": "1:19",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 268.591,
      "end": 271.099,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "their blood might not come upon our garments;",
      "verse": "1:19",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 271.279,
      "end": 274.205,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "otherwise their blood would come upon our garments,",
      "verse": "1:19",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 274.385,
      "end": 277.822,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and we would not be found spotless at the last day.",
      "verse": "1:19",
      "lineIndex": 79
    }
  ]
}